{
  "id": "GAL.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "GAL",
  "reference": "Galatians 1",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 24,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GAL 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "po"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paul, an apostle—sent not from men nor by a man, but by Jesus Christ and God the Father, who raised him from the dead—",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and all the brothers and sisters",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "with me,",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "po",
        "vid": "GAL 1:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "To the churches in Galatia:",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "po"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Grace and peace to you from God our Father and the Lord Jesus Christ,",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "who gave himself for our sins to rescue us from the present evil age, according to the will of our God and Father,",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to whom be glory for ever and ever. Amen.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "No Other Gospel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am astonished that you are so quickly deserting the one who called you to live in the grace of Christ and are turning to a different gospel—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which is really no gospel at all. Evidently some people are throwing you into confusion and are trying to pervert the gospel of Christ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But even if we or an angel from heaven should preach a gospel other than the one we preached to you, let them be under God's curse!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As we have already said, so now I say again: If anybody is preaching to you a gospel other than what you accepted, let them be under God's curse!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am I now trying to win the approval of human beings, or of God? Or am I trying to please people? If I were still trying to please people, I would not be a servant of Christ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paul Called by God",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I want you to know, brothers and sisters, that the gospel I preached is not of human origin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I did not receive it from any man, nor was I taught it; rather, I received it by revelation from Jesus Christ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For you have heard of my previous way of life in Judaism, how intensely I persecuted the church of God and tried to destroy it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I was advancing in Judaism beyond many of my own age among my people and was extremely zealous for the traditions of my fathers.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when God, who set me apart from my mother's womb and called me by his grace, was pleased",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to reveal his Son in me so that I might preach him among the Gentiles, my immediate response was not to consult any human being.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I did not go up to Jerusalem to see those who were apostles before I was, but I went into Arabia. Later I returned to Damascus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then after three years, I went up to Jerusalem to get acquainted with Cephas",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and stayed with him fifteen days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I saw none of the other apostles—only James, the Lord's brother.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I assure you before God that what I am writing you is no lie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I went to Syria and Cilicia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I was personally unknown to the churches of Judea that are in Christ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They only heard the report: \"The man who formerly persecuted us is now preaching the faith he once tried to destroy.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GAL 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they praised God because of me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GAL.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GAL.1.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "GAL.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "GAL"
  },
